-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §35 מענקים בגין תוצאות הערכה: from תשע"ב,
-- every school year, the 15% of a school's teachers whose evaluation (by
-- §19's model) is the highest get a one-time grant of 5,500 for a full
-- position, in proportion to the position and to the part of the year,
-- beyond a full position not counted; paid with July's salary, August's at
-- the latest; updated every June by the CPI; if the model is not ready for
-- תשע"ב, 650 to every teacher on the reform's terms that year; no hour
-- value, severance, percentage supplements or training fund, pension
-- contributions of 5% and 5%; not for substitutes only, nor for six months'
-- leave and more.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `35 מענקים בגין תוצאות הערכה`

DECLARE `Oz section 35 action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the evaluation grants of the school year`

§§ `35(א)`

-- (א): from תשע"ב and every school year after it, the teachers whose
-- evaluation results (by §19's evaluation model) are the highest of the
-- school's teachers evaluated in that year — 15% of the school's teachers
-- in all — are entitled to a one-time grant. A teacher is among them when
-- his place in the ranking is within 15% of the school's teachers, counted
-- exactly (convention rounding.default: a share is not rounded to whole
-- teachers), and teachers with equal results share a place (convention
-- thresholds.ties), as §20(ב) counts its bands.
@ref akn:art_35__para_a
`the share of the teachers section 35 rewards` MEANS 15%

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      `teachers evaluated above him` IS A NUMBER
      `the school's teachers` IS A NUMBER @desc the teachers of the school in that school year
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `among the best evaluated under section 35 in` y `teachers evaluated above him` `the school's teachers` IF
        y AT LEAST `the school year 5772`
    AND `teachers evaluated above him` PLUS 1 AT MOST `the share of the teachers section 35 rewards` TIMES `the school's teachers`

-- (א) ¶2: the grant for a teacher employed at 100% of a position is 5,500,
-- as signed; (ה) updates it.
@ref akn:art_35__para_a/p2
`the evaluation grant for a full position, as signed` MEANS 5500

§§ `35(ב)–(ג)`

-- (ב): a teacher employed part-time and/or in part of a school year (one on
-- unpaid leave or sabbatical in part of the year among them) is entitled to
-- the proportional part, by his position and/or the part of the year he was
-- employed. (ב) names no denominator for the part of the year: twelve
-- months, September to August (convention dates.school-year-share); (ו)'s
-- "(ספטמבר עד יוני)" is for (ו)'s own grant. (ג): employment beyond 100%
-- of a position is not counted.
--
-- F-oz-founding-35-a: (ב) does not say what maternity leave does to the
-- part of the year, where §36(ד) and §37 in the same part, in the same
-- words, except a teacher on maternity leave "לעניין תקופת חופשת הלידה".
-- The reading adopted (convention reading.contrast): here it is not
-- excepted, and a month of maternity leave is a month the teacher was not
-- employed for this grant.
@ref akn:art_35__para_b akn:art_35__para_c
GIVEN t IS AN `Oz grant teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the part of the year section 35(ב) counts for` t IS
    `the share of a school year` (t's `months employed`)

§§ `35(ד)`

-- (ד): the grants are paid with the July salary of the school year the
-- evaluation was given for, and at the latest with the salary paid for
-- August of that school year (convention dates.salary-month). A school
-- year y (by the calendar year it opens in) ends in July and August of
-- y + 1.
@ref akn:art_35__para_d
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary month of section 35's grants for school year` y IS
    `the Oz salary month` (y PLUS 1) 7

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the last salary month for section 35's grants for school year` y IS
    `the Oz salary month` (y PLUS 1) 8

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `the salary month paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 35's grants for school year` y `are paid in time with` `the salary month paid` IF
    `the salary month paid` AT MOST `the last salary month for section 35's grants for school year` y

`paying the evaluation grants` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the evaluation grants of the school year`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "§35(ד): the grants are paid with July's salary, and at the latest with August's, of the school year evaluated"

§§ `35(ה)`

-- (ה): the amounts are updated every June, from June 2012, by the change in
-- the CPI between the index published for May before the update and that
-- for May of the year before; "סכומי המענקים" are the section's grants,
-- (ו)'s among them. The arithmetic is common to part י's grants
-- (`an Oz grant updated each June`).
@ref akn:art_35__para_e
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      `the May indices` IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc the CPI for May of each year from May 2011 to the May before the last June update, in order
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a section 35 grant as updated` amount `the May indices` IS
    `an Oz grant updated each June` amount `the May indices`

§§ `35(ו)`

-- (ו): if the evaluation model is not ready for evaluating the teachers for
-- תשע"ב, then at the end of תשע"ב every teacher employed on the reform's
-- terms (in full or in part) in תשע"ב is entitled to a one-time grant: 650
-- for a full position; part-time or part of the year (unpaid leave or
-- sabbatical among them), the proportional part, the year being "ספטמבר עד
-- יוני" — ten months. Maternity leave is read as in (ב) (F-oz-founding-35-a).
@ref akn:art_35__para_f
`the section 35(ו) grant for a full position, as signed` MEANS 650

`the months of section 35(ו)'s year` MEANS 10

GIVEN t IS AN `Oz grant teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the part of the year section 35(ו) counts for` t IS
    t's `months employed from September to June` DIVIDED BY `the months of section 35(ו)'s year`

§§ `35(ז)–(ח)`

-- (ז): the grants are not in the base of the hour value, of severance pay
-- or of a percentage supplement, and no training fund contribution is made
-- on them. (ח): on them pension provident fund contributions are made, 5%
-- by the employer for benefits and 5% deducted from the teacher's salary
-- for benefits. Neither names the Dafna fund (convention
-- reading.closed-list).
@ref akn:art_35__para_g akn:art_35__para_h
GIVEN p IS A `what an Oz salary component counts for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the section 35 grants count for` p IF
    p EQUALS `contributions to a pension provident fund`

`the employer's pension contribution rate on a section 35 grant` MEANS 5%
`the teacher's pension deduction rate on a section 35 grant` MEANS 5%

§§ `35(ט)`

-- (ט): the section does not apply to a teacher employed by the employer
-- as a substitute only, nor to one on unpaid leave or sabbatical "למעלה
-- מ - 6 חודשים" of the school year (six months are not above six:
-- convention thresholds.above).
@ref akn:art_35__para_i
`the months of leave section 35(ט) allows` MEANS 6

GIVEN t IS AN `Oz grant teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 35 applies to` t IF
        NOT t's `a substitute only`
    AND NOT t's `months on unpaid leave or sabbatical` `is above` `the months of leave section 35(ט) allows`

§§ `35 -- the grants`

-- (א)–(ג), (ה) and (ט) together: the grant of a school year, from (א)'s
-- 5,500 as the May indices since May 2011 have updated it.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      t IS AN `Oz grant teacher`
      `teachers evaluated above him` IS A NUMBER
      `the school's teachers` IS A NUMBER
      `the May indices` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the evaluation grant under section 35` y t `teachers evaluated above him` `the school's teachers` `the May indices` IS
    IF      `section 35 applies to` t
        AND `among the best evaluated under section 35 in` y `teachers evaluated above him` `the school's teachers`
    THEN `an Oz grant pro rata` (`a section 35 grant as updated` `the evaluation grant for a full position, as signed` `the May indices`) (t's `position share`) (`the part of the year section 35(ב) counts for` t)
    ELSE 0

-- (ו) and (ט) together: the grant at the end of תשע"ב, where the model was
-- not ready, to a teacher on the reform's terms that year.
GIVEN `the model was ready to evaluate the teachers for 5772` IS A BOOLEAN
      t IS AN `Oz grant teacher` @desc in תשע"ב
      `the May indices` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the section 35(ו) grant` `the model was ready to evaluate the teachers for 5772` t `the May indices` IS
    IF      NOT `the model was ready to evaluate the teachers for 5772`
        AND NOT t's `on the reform's terms` EQUALS `off the Oz reform`
        AND `section 35 applies to` t
    THEN `an Oz grant pro rata` (`a section 35 grant as updated` `the section 35(ו) grant for a full position, as signed` `the May indices`) (t's `position share`) (`the part of the year section 35(ו) counts for` t)
    ELSE 0

§§ `35 -- illustrations`

GIVEN position IS A NUMBER, months IS A NUMBER, maternity IS A NUMBER, leave IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `Oz grant teacher`
DECIDE `a reform teacher at` position `for` months `months, with` maternity `on maternity leave and` leave `on leave` IS
    `Oz grant teacher` WITH
        `position share`                                   IS position
        `months employed`                                  IS months
        `months on maternity leave`                        IS maternity
        `months employed from September to June`           IS min months 10
        `months on maternity leave from September to June` IS maternity
        `months on unpaid leave or sabbatical`             IS leave
        `a substitute only`                                IS FALSE
        `on the reform's terms`                            IS `the Oz reform in part`

`no section 35 update yet` MEANS EMPTY

-- In a school of 40 teachers the best six are rewarded; the seventh is not.
#ASSERT `among the best evaluated under section 35 in` `the school year 5772` 5 40
#ASSERT NOT `among the best evaluated under section 35 in` `the school year 5772` 6 40
-- a full position all year: 5,500; at 120%, still 5,500; at half a
-- position for half the year, a quarter
#ASSERT `the evaluation grant under section 35` `the school year 5773` (`a reform teacher at` 1 `for` 12 `months, with` 0 `on maternity leave and` 0 `on leave`) 0 40 `no section 35 update yet` EQUALS 5500
#ASSERT `the evaluation grant under section 35` `the school year 5773` (`a reform teacher at` 1.2 `for` 12 `months, with` 0 `on maternity leave and` 0 `on leave`) 0 40 `no section 35 update yet` EQUALS 5500
#ASSERT `the evaluation grant under section 35` `the school year 5773` (`a reform teacher at` 0.5 `for` 6 `months, with` 0 `on maternity leave and` 6 `on leave`) 0 40 `no section 35 update yet` EQUALS 1375
-- seven months on sabbatical: none (six would still be paid in part)
#ASSERT `the evaluation grant under section 35` `the school year 5773` (`a reform teacher at` 1 `for` 5 `months, with` 0 `on maternity leave and` 7 `on leave`) 0 40 `no section 35 update yet` EQUALS 0
-- F-oz-founding-35-a's reading: three months of maternity leave are three
-- months not counted (§36(ד) would count them)
#ASSERT `the evaluation grant under section 35` `the school year 5773` (`a reform teacher at` 1 `for` 9 `months, with` 3 `on maternity leave and` 0 `on leave`) 0 40 `no section 35 update yet` EQUALS 4125
-- (ו): 650 for ten months of September to June
#ASSERT `the section 35(ו) grant` FALSE (`a reform teacher at` 1 `for` 12 `months, with` 0 `on maternity leave and` 0 `on leave`) `no section 35 update yet` EQUALS 650
#ASSERT `the section 35(ו) grant` TRUE (`a reform teacher at` 1 `for` 12 `months, with` 0 `on maternity leave and` 0 `on leave`) `no section 35 update yet` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `section 35's grants for school year` `the school year 5772` `are paid in time with` (`the Oz salary month` 2012 8)
#ASSERT NOT `section 35's grants for school year` `the school year 5772` `are paid in time with` (`the Oz salary month` 2012 9)
#ASSERT `the section 35 grants count for` `contributions to a pension provident fund` AND NOT `the section 35 grants count for` `contributions to a training fund`
#ASSERT NOT `the section 35 grants count for` `computing the hour value`
#ASSERT `a section 35 grant as updated` 5500 (LIST 100, 102) EQUALS 5610

-- F-oz-founding-35-a's evidence: (ב) and (ו) except no maternity leave, so
-- a teacher on maternity leave for part of the year is paid less than one
-- at work the whole of it, as she would not be under §36(ד).
`section 35 counts maternity leave against the grant` MEANS
    `the evaluation grant under section 35` `the school year 5773` (`a reform teacher at` 1 `for` 9 `months, with` 3 `on maternity leave and` 0 `on leave`) 0 40 `no section 35 update yet`
        LESS THAN `the evaluation grant under section 35` `the school year 5773` (`a reform teacher at` 1 `for` 12 `months, with` 0 `on maternity leave and` 0 `on leave`) 0 40 `no section 35 update yet`
#ASSERT `section 35 counts maternity leave against the grant`
